# AAP Attestation Demo

A minimal Node.js WebSocket server/client pair implementing the AAP protocol.

## Files
- server.js - WebSocket server on port 3000, path /aap
- client.js - Client that connects and verifies

## Usage

1. Start the server:
   node server.js
